<details><summary>Can I import a Markdown file?</summary><p>Open Import a file, keep source notes, or use more editing tools, then choose Import an article. UTF-8 .md and .txt files up to 512 KiB can be previewed before replacement. Articles support up to 60,000 characters, including Unicode. Oversized article pastes are rejected in full with a message beside the editor. Supported single-line front matter maps into page fields; complex YAML is rejected without replacing your work. <a href="/help/article-import/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Import details (new tab)</a>.</p></details>
